      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a set of behavioral and visual indicators for your staff to consider: suspicious guests may display unusual or aggressive behavior, such as agitation, Arguing with colleagues or staff members, displaying excessive alcohol consumption, leering at or harassing other guests. They may also appear disheveled, intoxicated, or visibly intoxicated; display signs of substance abuse; or carry unusual amounts of cash orAlternative identification papers.\n\nAdditionally, individuals who appear out of place or struggling to pay for items in their vicinity, or behave in an overly secretive or aggressive manner.",
